{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:44:26.402Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"74313b4054d995ecb7a8f190d78a4a7542a574242a4263b8f50b05264528a04c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@Ruth Calloway, from Moss's digests (the Strategic cheat sheet and digests through 9/30):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, when Nadia's industrial account was reassigned in the CRM. Moss's 5/4 digest records the reassignment as effective that day.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management that day. Older digests already list it as his, so the handoff date is unclear.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, based on the 12/1 and 9/30 digests. Those digests don't record a handoff date, and the cheat sheet still lists the medical account under Nadia, so please confirm before the slide goes out.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. They call it the pod's outdoor/retail account and show Nadia volunteering for its training session, but that isn't an ownership statement. Please check the CRM.\n\nFor the board slide, the Vantorre Group date is the one to use: 2026-05-04."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:44:32.676Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5f6d83ee9392e289babc0639a4535d9fb1e8a1493d86d2662b7c132b71595c78","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@Ruth Calloway, correction to my last message on Orlavine Medical Supply. The cheat sheet doesn't mention the medical account at all, so I was wrong to say it lists it under Nadia. The earlier digests are the ones that point to Nadia: the 3/10/2025 digest calls it \"Nadia's medical account\". The later ones (9/30/2026 and 12/1/2025) call it \"Gideon's medical account\", and the digests don't record a handoff. Please check the CRM before the slide goes out. The Vantorre Group date (2026-05-04) is unchanged."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
